35
00:01:03,765 --> 00:01:05,780
Those were our ancestors.

36
00:01:06,105 --> 00:01:08,111
The asteroid didn't kill the dinosaurs.

37
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:10,781
It turned off the sun.

38
00:01:10,983 --> 00:01:12,468
And that pigeon outside your window?

39
00:01:12,867 --> 00:01:14,572
Still a dinosaur.

40
00:01:14,852 --> 00:01:17,865
Follow for more why the fuck

41
00:01:17,885 --> 00:01:18,991
science.

